=== 16.A VERDICT: all 7 flags HAVE an off-path test. NO flag is missing one. ===
    Coverage is uneven in KIND, not in presence:
      - VERDICT_GATE / FIX_BEFORE_VERIFY / SWEEP_DETECTION_PHASE get fixture-equality
        against the real dossier cascade (strongest).
      - DECISION_LEDGER / TICKET_PLAN_VALIDATOR get byte-identical context equality.
      - SWEEP_CADENCE_GATE gets a "spends nothing" assertion.
      - VERIFIED_HEAD_COMPLETION's /complete-route twin has NO route-level off test
        of its own; its off behaviour is inferred from normaliser parity (16.4).
        That is the one soft spot -- see the caveat in 16.4.

