=== 16.2  the two answers that matter ===

  flag value UNSET (a deploy that never sets it):
      normalizeVerdictMode               -> shadow
      normalizeVerifiedHeadMode          -> shadow
      normalizeSweepCadenceMode          -> shadow
      normalizeTicketPlanValidatorMode   -> shadow
      normalizeDecisionLedgerMode        -> shadow

  flag value UNRECOGNIZED (a typo in the task definition):
      normalizeVerdictMode               -> off  <-- FAILS OPEN: the gate silently stops running
      normalizeVerifiedHeadMode          -> off  <-- FAILS OPEN: the gate silently stops running
      normalizeSweepCadenceMode          -> off  <-- FAILS OPEN: the gate silently stops running
      normalizeTicketPlanValidatorMode   -> off  <-- FAILS OPEN: the gate silently stops running
      normalizeDecisionLedgerMode        -> shadow  <-- still writes

