=== ITEM 16 VERDICT ===
  Four of the five normalisers fall an unrecognized value to `off`, so a typo
  in VERDICT_GATE / FIX_BEFORE_VERIFY / VERIFIED_HEAD_COMPLETION /
  SWEEP_DETECTION_PHASE / SWEEP_CADENCE_GATE / TICKET_PLAN_VALIDATOR silently
  disables that gate with no log line. DECISION_LEDGER is the exception:
  anything unrecognized lands on `shadow`, so it keeps writing. Unset is
  `shadow` everywhere — no flag ships enforcing.
